privacy.notice:
🔒 **Privacy**

What the bot stores about you:
• your Telegram id, username, first name and language;
• your portfolio entries and sales;
• settings (language, time zone);
• a log of which commands you used (without amounts or prices);
• payments and your plan, if you bought one.

The bot never asks for exchange API keys or wallet access.
Activity logs are capped and old entries are removed.

/delete_me erases your portfolio, settings, activity and alert history. Payment records and an already paid plan are kept for accounting.
